{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition","poincares-inequalities","poincaré-不等式","problems"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Poincaré Inequalities","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p><a id=\"poincaré-不等式\"></a></p>\n<h1>Poincaré 不等式</h1>\n<p><a href=\"#/learn/pde.overview?anchor=definition\">Lawrence C.Evans Partial differential equations 5.8.1</a></p>\n<p>我们曾在 <a href=\"#/learn/pde.sobolev-inequalities-i?anchor=definition\">GNS 不等式的有界情况</a> 的最后提到过<br/>\n<span class=\"math inline\">u</span> 能否被 <span class=\"math inline\">Du</span> 控制与 <span class=\"math inline\">u</span> 是否存在等于 0 的部分是有很大区别的。<br/>\n因此我们建立 Poincaré 不等式就是为了消除 <span class=\"math inline\">u</span> 上下平移带来的影响。</p>\n<p>记</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n(u)_U = {-\\mkern -19mu\\int}_{U} u\n</div>\n<p>为 <span class=\"math inline\">u</span> 在 <span class=\"math inline\">U</span> 上的平均。</p>\n<p><a id=\"poincares-inequalities\"></a></p>\n<h2>Poincare's inequalities</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math inline\">U \\subset \\mathbb{R}^n</span> 是 <em>有界连通开集</em> ，<span class=\"math inline\">\\partial U</span> 是 <span class=\"math inline\">C^1</span> 的。<br/>\n设 <span class=\"math inline\">1 \\le p \\le \\infty</span>，那么存在常数 <span class=\"math inline\">C=C(n,p,U)</span> 使得对于任何 <span class=\"math inline\">u \\in W^{1,p}(U)</span></p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\|u-(u)_U\\|_{L^p(U)} \\le C \\|Du\\|_{L^p(U)}\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"#/learn/pde.sobolev-inequalities-ii?anchor=rellich-kondrachov-compactness-theorem-2\">Rellich-Kondrachov Compactness Theorem</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#/learn/pde.smooth-approximation?anchor=definition\">Du=0, u=c a.e.</a> Corollary</p>\n<p><a id=\"problems\"></a></p>\n<h2>配套习题（Exercises）</h2>\n<p>上述记号与结论可继续用于原稿练习：<a href=\"#/learn/pde.poincare-inequality-exercises?anchor=problems\">进入习题库中的本讲题目与题解</a>。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Poincaré 不等式</td>\n<td>Poincaré Inequalities</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不等式</td>\n<td>inequality</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子列</td>\n<td>subsequence</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入</td>\n<td>embedding</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列</td>\n<td>sequence</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开集</td>\n<td>open set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收敛</td>\n<td>convergence</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紧性</td>\n<td>compactness</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连通</td>\n<td>connected</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"pde.poincare-inequality.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"pde.poincare-inequality","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"Poincaré 不等式"}],"anchors":["definition","poincares-inequalities","poincaré-不等式","problems"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition","poincares-inequalities","poincaré-不等式","problems"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Poincaré Inequalities","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p><a id=\"poincaré-不等式\"></a></p>\n<h1>Poincaré 不等式</h1>\n<p><a href=\"#/learn/pde.overview?anchor=definition\">Lawrence C.Evans Partial differential equations 5.8.1</a></p>\n<p>我们曾在 <a href=\"#/learn/pde.sobolev-inequalities-i?anchor=definition\">GNS 不等式的有界情况</a> 的最后提到过<br/>\n<span class=\"math inline\">u</span> 能否被 <span class=\"math inline\">Du</span> 控制与 <span class=\"math inline\">u</span> 是否存在等于 0 的部分是有很大区别的。<br/>\n因此我们建立 Poincaré 不等式就是为了消除 <span class=\"math inline\">u</span> 上下平移带来的影响。</p>\n<p>记</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n(u)_U = {-\\mkern -19mu\\int}_{U} u\n</div>\n<p>为 <span class=\"math inline\">u</span> 在 <span class=\"math inline\">U</span> 上的平均。</p>\n<p><a id=\"poincares-inequalities\"></a></p>\n<h2>Poincare's inequalities</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math inline\">U \\subset \\mathbb{R}^n</span> 是 <em>有界连通开集</em> ，<span class=\"math inline\">\\partial U</span> 是 <span class=\"math inline\">C^1</span> 的。<br/>\n设 <span class=\"math inline\">1 \\le p \\le \\infty</span>，那么存在常数 <span class=\"math inline\">C=C(n,p,U)</span> 使得对于任何 <span class=\"math inline\">u \\in W^{1,p}(U)</span></p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\|u-(u)_U\\|_{L^p(U)} \\le C \\|Du\\|_{L^p(U)}\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"#/learn/pde.sobolev-inequalities-ii?anchor=rellich-kondrachov-compactness-theorem-2\">Rellich-Kondrachov Compactness Theorem</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#/learn/pde.smooth-approximation?anchor=definition\">Du=0, u=c a.e.</a> Corollary</p>\n<p><a id=\"problems\"></a></p>\n<h2>配套习题（Exercises）</h2>\n<p>上述记号与结论可继续用于原稿练习：<a href=\"#/learn/pde.poincare-inequality-exercises?anchor=problems\">进入习题库中的本讲题目与题解</a>。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Poincaré 不等式</td>\n<td>Poincaré Inequalities</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不等式</td>\n<td>inequality</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子列</td>\n<td>subsequence</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入</td>\n<td>embedding</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列</td>\n<td>sequence</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开集</td>\n<td>open set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收敛</td>\n<td>convergence</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紧性</td>\n<td>compactness</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连通</td>\n<td>connected</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"pde.poincare-inequality.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"pde.poincare-inequality","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"Poincaré 不等式"}],"available_articles":[{"anchors":["definition","poincares-inequalities","poincaré-不等式","problems"],"english_title":"Poincaré Inequalities","id":"pde.poincare-inequality.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"pde.poincare-inequality","title":"Poincaré 不等式"}],"bibliography":[],"contains":[],"content_status":"available","default_articles":["pde.poincare-inequality.main"],"english_title":"Poincaré Inequalities","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p><a id=\"poincaré-不等式\"></a></p>\n<h1>Poincaré 不等式</h1>\n<p><a href=\"#/learn/pde.overview?anchor=definition\">Lawrence C.Evans Partial differential equations 5.8.1</a></p>\n<p>我们曾在 <a href=\"#/learn/pde.sobolev-inequalities-i?anchor=definition\">GNS 不等式的有界情况</a> 的最后提到过<br/>\n<span class=\"math inline\">u</span> 能否被 <span class=\"math inline\">Du</span